00:10:50,526 --> 00:10:56,526
DragonHeart is a fantasy, action, adventure film directed by Rob Cohen.

3
00:16:15,789 --> 00:16:21,789
In an ancient time when majestic fire-breathers soared through the skies, a knight named Bowen
comes face to face and heart to heart with the last dragon on Earth, Draco.

4
00:21:41,052 --> 00:21:47,052
Taking up arms to suppress a tyrant king, Bowen soon realizes his task will be
harder than he'd imagined: If he kills the king, Draco will die as well.

5
